{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Heat 'n Hit: Prologue</i>, you\u2019ll experience a free, limited version of <i>Heat 'n Hit: The Blacksmith Simulator</i>. In this introduction to the full game, you\u2019ll take your first steps as a blacksmith apprentice in a vibrant medieval fantasy world, progressing up to the Professional reputation within the first map. Try core forging mechanics, serve customers, and manage your workshop. Don\u2019t forget to wishlist the full game to continue your journey at launch! <br><br>Take over your missing grandfather's workshop and dive into a journey of forging, mystery, and discovery in a vibrant and stylized medieval fantasy world. In <i>Heat 'n Hit</i>, you have total freedom: relax while fulfilling customer requests, explore new cities in search of rare materials, or join the guild to help heroes on daring quests. What will you do? It's up to you!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Forge and repair legendary weapons</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Serve clients from diverse backgrounds, each with unique requests, and craft swords, axes, spears, and other gear with full control over every forging step. You can also repair damaged weapons. Combine rare metals, polish and sharpen them, and deliver true masterpieces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927410/extras/a1803f84f61c7022425ad8cdf7d8f00c.poster.avif?t=1757965830\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927410/extras/a1803f84f61c7022425ad8cdf7d8f00c.webm?t=1757965830\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927410/extras/a1803f84f61c7022425ad8cdf7d8f00c.mp4?t=1757965830\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Manage your workshop</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep your inventory organized: ores, ingots, reagents, handles, and special components. Buy from merchants, trade with adventurers, earn from side quests, explore new cities, and progress as a blacksmith to access rarer and better materials. Upgrade your forge and unlock new workstations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927410/extras/2385dc74dbfcaac6df5862ed512fdce6.poster.avif?t=1757965830\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927410/extras/2385dc74dbfcaac6df5862ed512fdce6.webm?t=1757965830\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927410/extras/2385dc74dbfcaac6df5862ed512fdce6.mp4?t=1757965830\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore cities and daily life</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step outside your forge to visit taverns, shops, the adventurer\u2019s guild, and resource-gathering spots. Complete side quests or just immerse yourself in a rich and detailed world. Each city brings new challenges, clients, and opportunities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927410/extras/0b790e1691bfdb33052b1577dbcbf9e4.poster.avif?t=1757965830\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927410/extras/0b790e1691bfdb33052b1577dbcbf9e4.webm?t=1757965830\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927410/extras/0b790e1691bfdb33052b1577dbcbf9e4.mp4?t=1757965830\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Progression, reputation, and day cycle</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game <strong>features</strong> a full day\u2013night cycle. Work during the day, explore at night, or sleep to advance time. Grow your reputation to unlock rare metals, new recipes, and high-tier clients. Each level of reputation opens doors to greater rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927410/extras/fe68fc90197bd56afc2ef57b6a913697.poster.avif?t=1757965830\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927410/extras/fe68fc90197bd56afc2ef57b6a913697.webm?t=1757965830\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927410/extras/fe68fc90197bd56afc2ef57b6a913697.mp4?t=1757965830\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A story of mystery and legacy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your grandfather vanished without a trace. By taking over his forge, you'll uncover hidden clues, old documents, and suspicious accounts. What happened to him? What secrets lie within your workshop?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927410/extras/bf19dc120928bcfda0ef7682ea08adc2.poster.avif?t=1757965830\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927410/extras/bf19dc120928bcfda0ef7682ea08adc2.webm?t=1757965830\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927410/extras/bf19dc120928bcfda0ef7682ea08adc2.mp4?t=1757965830\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Collect unique cards</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughout your journey, you'll find rare illustrated cards as rewards for quests or hidden across the world. Complete your collection and unlock beautiful artwork and curious lore about characters, weapons, and legends from <i>Heat 'n Hit</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927410/extras/c5de44439eaf83d77f3099f13478a88d.poster.avif?t=1757965830\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927410/extras/c5de44439eaf83d77f3099f13478a88d.webm?t=1757965830\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927410/extras/c5de44439eaf83d77f3099f13478a88d.mp4?t=1757965830\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A casual game with depth</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With stylized visuals, an intuitive interface, and gameplay that balances immersion and management, <i>Heat 'n Hit</i> is perfect for players seeking an accessible, engaging blacksmith simulator. Whether you want to unwind or dive deep into perfect weapon builds, this is your place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927410/extras/202a4fd19d0e5e0f34a265cfe7da1dcf.poster.avif?t=1757965830\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927410/extras/202a4fd19d0e5e0f34a265cfe7da1dcf.webm?t=1757965830\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927410/extras/202a4fd19d0e5e0f34a265cfe7da1dcf.mp4?t=1757965830\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can you forge legendary weapons and uncover the mystery behind your grandfather\u2019s disappearance?</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3927410?t=1757965830","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927410/6c6af1a658dc0547c8bb81ff180663283617f85e/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757965830","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927410/7bf34c674ff8b1bc9383c70c481dde54150c61a9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757965830","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927410/7bf34c674ff8b1bc9383c70c481dde54150c61a9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757965830","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Heat 'n Hit: Prologue</i>, you\u2019ll experience a free, limited version of <i>Heat 'n Hit: The Blacksmith Simulator</i>. In this introduction to the full game, you\u2019ll take your first steps as a blacksmith apprentice in a vibrant medieval fantasy world, progressing up to the Professional reputation within the first map. Try core forging mechanics, serve customers, and manage your workshop. Don\u2019t forget to wishlist the full game to continue your journey at launch! <br><br>Take over your missing grandfather's workshop and dive into a journey of forging, mystery, and discovery in a vibrant and stylized medieval fantasy world. In <i>Heat 'n Hit</i>, you have total freedom: relax while fulfilling customer requests, explore new cities in search of rare materials, or join the guild to help heroes on daring quests. What will you do? It's up to you!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Forge and repair legendary weapons</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Serve clients from diverse backgrounds, each with unique requests, and craft swords, axes, spears, and other gear with full control over every forging step. You can also repair damaged weapons. Combine rare metals, polish and sharpen them, and deliver true masterpieces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927410/extras/a1803f84f61c7022425ad8cdf7d8f00c.poster.avif?t=1757965830\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927410/extras/a1803f84f61c7022425ad8cdf7d8f00c.webm?t=1757965830\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927410/extras/a1803f84f61c7022425ad8cdf7d8f00c.mp4?t=1757965830\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Manage your workshop</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep your inventory organized: ores, ingots, reagents, handles, and special components. Buy from merchants, trade with adventurers, earn from side quests, explore new cities, and progress as a blacksmith to access rarer and better materials. Upgrade your forge and unlock new workstations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927410/extras/2385dc74dbfcaac6df5862ed512fdce6.poster.avif?t=1757965830\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927410/extras/2385dc74dbfcaac6d